WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.969
[ Knock on door ]
-Come on in.

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:05.071
Hey, Orlando.
-Hey, Jimmy.

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:06.706
How are you, man?
-I'm doing great, man.

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:09.542
I'm just working on one of those
"Me, Also Me" tweets.

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.510
-What's that mean?
-It's a thing people do

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:13.279
on Twitter where
you say a thing about you

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.281
and then another thing
also about you

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:18.284
that undermines the first thing
in a humorous way.

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.119
For example, me, I'm on a diet.

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:22.856
Also me,
ketchup is a vegetable, right?

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.156
-Oh. Right.

00:00:24.156 --> 00:00:27.960
So like, me, my TV show
"Carnival Row" is out now.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.564
Also me, my movie "The Outpost"
is coming out soon.

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:32.932
-Mm, no, no, no.

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.801
More like, me, "Ugh!
The summer is too hot.

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:37.637
Also me, "Ugh!
The winter is too cold."

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:41.040
-Ah, right. So me, I played a
sexy elf in "Lord of the Rings."

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.676
Also me,
I played the sexy pirate

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.278
in "Pirates of the Caribbean,"
right?

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:48.381
-No. Me, I'm a sophisticated,
mature adult.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:51.250
Also me, I wish they showed
Saturday-morning cartoons

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.619
all of the other days
and times, too.

00:00:53.619 --> 00:00:55.755
-Me, I'm engaged to Katy Perry.

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:58.524
Also me, Katy Perry
is beautiful, and I love her.

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:01.294
-Me, I hate it when people are
inconsiderate at the workplace.

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:04.497
Also me, does anybody mind if I
reheat my fish in the microwave?

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:06.499
-Me, I'm a goodwill ambassador

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.401
for the charity organization
UNICEF.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:11.604
Also me, UNICEF does important
work in over 190 countries

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:12.705
to save the lives of children.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:14.140
-No, no, no, no, no!
Look!

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.676
It's me, I'm trying
to look at my phone less!

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:19.678
Also me, "Oh, look! I just got
a new follower on Instagram!"

00:01:19.678 --> 00:01:21.414
-I get it.
Me, I like pizza.

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.283
Also me, pizza tastes good.

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:24.717
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:26.386
Did I do it right?

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:27.553
-Sure.

00:01:27.553 --> 00:01:29.255
[ Cheers and applause ]

